     "content": "The user wants me to explain crime-link scores for two pairs. I need to write one short reason per factor using ONLY the rows given, citing plate, place, time, MO words. Then a one-sentence rationale and recommended next action.\n\nLet me analyze each pair:\n\nPair 1: CHN-GU-2025-000945 | CHN-NA-2025-000990\n- Both cab_robbery\n- Distance 1.6 km, 11 days apart\n- Factors: space_time (0.33), vehicle (0.78), suspect_description (1.0), weapon_tool (1.0)\n- Crime A: plate TN22??7312, white Maruti Swift Dzire, near Hilton Chennai Guindy, 2025-08-18 00:11, 3 offenders heavy build 25-35, knife, MO: posed_as_ride_hailing_cab, drove_away_in_car, hotel_nearby_or_parking, target man_aged_35, cash_and_mobile_phone, night, knife_shown_to_threaten\n- Crime B: plate TN22C?73??, white Maruti Swift Dzire, near Amma Unavagam Nandambakkam, 2025-08-28 23:20, 3 offenders heavy build 25-35, knife, MO null\n\nPair 2: CHN-GU-2025-000945 | CHN-VL-2025-000926\n- Crime A: cab_robbery, Crime B: street_robbery\n- Distance 4.1 km, 4.5 days apart\n- Factors: space_time (0.18), suspect_description (0.83), weapon_tool (1.0)\n- Crime B: near Canara Bank Velachery, 2025-08-13 11:53, no vehicles, 3 offenders heavy build 30-40, knife, MO null\n\nNow I need to write reasons for each factor citing specific details.\n\nFor Pair 1:\n- space_time: 1.6 km apart, 11 days apart, both night (00:11 and 23:20), near Hilton Guindy vs Amma Unavagam Nandambakkam\n- vehicle: both white Maruti Swift Dzire, plates TN22??7312 and TN22C?73?? share TN22 and 73 pattern\n- suspect_description: both 3 offenders, heavy build, age 25-35\n- weapon_tool: both knife\n\nFor Pair 2:\n- space_time: 4.1 km, 4.5 days, night vs day (00:11 vs 11:53), Guindy vs Velachery\n- suspect_description: both 3 offenders heavy build, age bands 25-35 vs 30-40 overlap\n- weapon_tool: both knife\n\nNow write JSON.</think>{\n  \"pairs\": {\n    \"CHN-GU-2025-000945|CHN-NA-2025-000990\": {\n      \"factors\": {\n        \"space_time\": \"1.6 km between near Hilton Chennai Guindy (00:11) and near Amma Unavagam Nandambakkam (23:20), 11 days apart, both night-time\",\n        \"vehicle\": \"Both used white Maruti Swift Dzire; plates TN22??7312 and TN22C?73?? share TN22 prefix and 73 digits\",\n        \"suspect_description\": \"Identical: 3 offenders, heavy build, age 25-35\",\n        \"weapon_tool\": \"Both involved knife\"\n      },\n      \"rationale\": \"Strong vehicle plate overlap and identical suspect description link two cab robberies 1.6 km apart within 11 days, though MO details missing for the second crime.\",\n      \"recommended_action\": \"Run ANPR trail for TN22??7312/TN22C?73?? around both locations 2025-08-18 to 2025-08-28; obtain full MO for CHN-NA-2025-000990 to confirm posed_as_ride_hailing_cab approach.\"\n    },\n    \"CHN-GU-2025-000945|CHN-VL-2025-000926\": {\n      \"factors\": {\n        \"space_time\": \"4.1 km between near Hilton Chennai Guindy (00:11 night) and near Canara Bank Velachery (11:53 day), 4.5 days apart, different time bands\",\n        \"suspect_description\": \"Both 3 offenders, heavy build; age bands 25-35 and 30-40 overlap\",\n        \"weapon_tool\": \"Both involved knife\"\n      },\n      \"rationale\": \"Shared heavy-build trio and knife use across cab and street robbery types, but wider distance, day/night split, and no vehicle link weaken the connection.\",\n      \"recommended_action\": \"Check CCTV near Canara Bank Velachery 2025-08-13 11:53 for white Swift Dzire; compare offender descriptions with Guindy team; query known offenders with heavy-build trio MO in both wards.\"\n    }\n  }\n}"
